      "content": {
        "heading": "Resistance and Ohm's Law",
        "bullets": [
          "Formula: V = I * R",
          "R is the Resistance of the conductor.",
          "Resistance is the property to oppose the flow of charges.",
          "SI unit of Resistance is Ohm (Ω)."
        ],
        "imageUrl": "/images/electricity_lab_setup.jpg"
